{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sky Fit API - Tarea 5 (JWT)",
    "description": "API de Sky Fit protegida con JSON Web Tokens (expiración de 5 minutos).\n\n1. Ejecuta 'JWT - Tarea 5 / 1. Login' → guarda el token en la variable {{token}}.\n2. Ejecuta '2. Perfil con Bearer válido' → 200.\n3. Espera más de 5 minutos y ejecuta '3. Perfil con token expirado' → 401 token_expired.\n\nLa colección usa Bearer {{token}} por defecto (todo el CRUD de productos es privado); solo registro y login usan 'No Auth'. Crear/editar/eliminar productos usa {{adminToken}} (ejecuta 'Login admin' primero). Cambia baseUrl por https://skyfit-t5.onrender.com/api para probar el backend desplegado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productoId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "JWT - Tarea 5",
      "description": "Flujo completo del token: login, petición autorizada y petición con token vencido.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login (obtiene el token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve un token JWT', () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.usuario._id);",
                  "// Muestra cuándo vence el token (exp viene en segundos)",
                  "const payload = JSON.parse(atob(json.token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
                  "console.log('Payload:', payload, 'Vence:', new Date(payload.exp * 1000).toLocaleTimeString());",
                  "pm.test('Vida del token = 5 minutos', () => pm.expect(payload.exp - payload.iat).to.eql(300));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"damaris@skyfit.com\",\n  \"password\": \"skyfit123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Valida credenciales y firma un JWT con { id, email, role } que vence en 5 minutos."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - token generado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"damaris@skyfit.com\",\n  \"password\": \"skyfit123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"mensaje\": \"Inicio de sesión exitoso.\",\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhYzcxYTcwZTc3N2I4ZTE4OWQzMmQzMyIsImVtYWlsIjoiZGFtYXJpc0Bza3lmaXQuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6ImNsaWVudGUiLCJpYXQiOjE3OTE4NTg3MTQsImV4cCI6MTc5MTg1OTAxNH0.<firma>\",\n  \"usuario\": {\n    \"_id\": \"6ac71a70e777b8e189d32d33\",\n    \"nombre\": \"Damaris Cabrera\",\n    \"correo\": \"damaris@skyfit.com\",\n    \"rol\": \"cliente\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Perfil con Bearer válido (→ 200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Endpoint protegido. Envía Authorization: Bearer {{token}} dentro de los 5 minutos de vida del token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - acceso autorizado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"_id\": \"6ac71a70e777b8e189d32d33\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Damaris Cabrera\",\n  \"correo\": \"damaris@skyfit.com\",\n  \"rol\": \"cliente\",\n  \"membresia\": \"Premium\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Perfil con token expirado - esperar 5 min (→ 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('error = token_expired', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('token_expired'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Misma petición que la 2, ejecutada DESPUÉS de que pasen los 5 minutos desde el login. El middleware captura TokenExpiredError y responde 401 con error 'token_expired'."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "401 - token expirado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{userId}}"
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"token_expired\",\n  \"message\": \"La sesión ha expirado o ya no es válida. Por favor, inicie sesión nuevamente.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Listar productos sin token (→ 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('error = token_missing', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('token_missing'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/productos",
            "description": "Las consultas GET de productos también son privadas: sin Bearer → 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Crear producto sin token (→ 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/productos",
            "description": "Sin cabecera Authorization el middleware responde 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Cliente intenta crear producto (→ 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/productos",
            "description": "Token válido pero con rol cliente: solo admin puede crear productos."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
